    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>You gain a one-point icon relationship with the Elf Queen. This represents your strong connection to the fey realm and its inhabitants over civilized elven society in the mortal realm. Elves notice this connection and treat you with added respect.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Starting from 3rd level, choose either sorcerer spells with the Fey keyword, or druid spells from the Circle of the Feysong. You can switch out a bard spell for a spell of the chosen type at a -2 level penalty.</p>"
